## Why This Is Asked

Tests multi-region privacy, data locality, and cross-region consistency. It probes how to scale cca scoring while preventing data leakage and ensuring auditable drift checks.

## Key Concepts

- Data locality and privacy masking
- Region-scoped stores with immutable logs
- Idempotent upserts and client_timestamp semantics
- Drift detection per region and asynchronous global reconciliation
- Canary rollout and rollback mechanics

